                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "696932d2-17ec-3bf0-a242-d151d60b45bf",
                        "entry_id": "b130e4c2-c3cb-3f09-b9a5-fddc474b80fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Announcement; declaration."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0fdca144-c5eb-4f2e-9911-b117c3ede93a",
                                "sense_id": "696932d2-17ec-3bf0-a242-d151d60b45bf",
                                "text": "They made an edict with an intimation that whosoever killed a stork, should be banished."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "327c99b5-a759-3a43-b2a0-7c75ac74769a",
                        "entry_id": "b130e4c2-c3cb-3f09-b9a5-fddc474b80fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hint; an obscure or indirect suggestion or notice; a remote or ambiguous reference."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1c5f0be-e454-4705-88c8-bc658ca38bd6",
                                "sense_id": "327c99b5-a759-3a43-b2a0-7c75ac74769a",
                                "text": "Without mentioning the king of England, or giving the least intimation that he was sent by him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d5b143c-45ab-4065-858a-0c4714deb8a9",
                                "sense_id": "327c99b5-a759-3a43-b2a0-7c75ac74769a",
                                "text": "At length, perchance, the immaterial heaven will appear as much higher to the American mind, and the intimations that star it as much brighter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "161cc17c-0006-40ea-b27c-190121caf08c",
                                "sense_id": "327c99b5-a759-3a43-b2a0-7c75ac74769a",
                                "text": "And actually I had important intimations to communicate as he faced the end. But intimations weren't much use."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
